flowchart TB
  subgraph Inbound[核实的真实 B站入站场景]
    DM[私信消息 UID / event ID]
    PUB[公开评论或入站 @ UID / rpid]
  end
  FRIEND[SocialPolicyGate.actor / 当前名册 / 账号未冻结]
  PORT[SocialPortraitGateway
有证据、可撤回的交流偏好]
  LEDGER[(当前账号 runtime
social-portrait/evidence-v1.json)]
  ADMIN[同源管理页
查看 / 纠正 / 撤回 / 清空]
  ASSEMBLY[SocialContextAssembler.getPortrait
按 UID 及渠道读取]
  CONTEXT[InteractionBatcher.portraitContext
独立低敏证据字段、不参与人格]
  MODEL[SocialAutonomyDecisionContract
Life Voice 唯一人格 / 情绪]
  GATE[SocialPolicyGate + P6/Rhythm + 额度 / 回执]
  SEND[原有私信 / 评论发送器]
  DM --> FRIEND
  PUB --> FRIEND
  FRIEND -->|仅白名单 UID、明确低敏表达| PORT
  PORT <--> LEDGER
  ADMIN -->|人工同源确认| PORT
  LEDGER -->|DM 允许私信+公开证据
公开评论只允许公开证据| ASSEMBLY
  ASSEMBLY --> CONTEXT
  CONTEXT --> MODEL
  MODEL -->|回复意愿并非发送授权| GATE
  GATE --> SEND
  subgraph Interest[原有 LifeInterests 扩展，无新人格 / 发送系统]
    WATCH[经证据验证的 selected watch/BV]
    TOPICS[TOPICS 原有分类
核心与学习兴趣维持原证据门槛]
    CURIOSITY[(interests.json
短期 curiosityCandidates)]
    CHOOSE[selectionInterests
每 3 天最多一槽，14 天过期]
    DUTY[现有选片 promptFor
仍需只读视频权限]
    WATCH --> TOPICS
    WATCH -->|未知但安全标题| CURIOSITY
    TOPICS --> CHOOSE
    CURIOSITY --> CHOOSE
    CHOOSE --> DUTY
  end
